      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "[简体中文](README.md) · **English**"
    },
    {
      "section": "Email",
      "text": "**Handle mail in DSH and review replies before sending.**\n\n[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-email) [](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-email) [](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-email)\n\n**[Install](#install) · [Workflow](#start-using-it) · [Full guide](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-email/blob/main/docs/REFERENCE.en.md)**"
    },
    {
      "section": "Email",
      "text": "<picture>\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 640px)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-email/main/docs/assets/intro/workflow-en-mobile-dark.svg\">\n  <source media=\"(max-width: 640px)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-email/main/docs/assets/intro/workflow-en-mobile-light.svg\">\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-email/main/docs/assets/intro/workflow-en-dark.svg\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-email/main/docs/assets/intro/workflow-en-light.svg\" alt=\"Handle mail in DSH and review replies before sending. · workflow illustration\" width=\"100%\">\n</picture>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "- Use IMAP/POP3/SMTP, Outlook OAuth or AgentMail accounts.\n- Read messages, search and download attachments in the workbench.\n- Review the sender, To/Cc, content and attachments before confirming.\n\n<details>\n<summary>See a workbench example</summary>\n\nActual interface with controlled validation data; the PPTX image is a rendered sample when shown.\n\n</details>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "Formatted reading, longer quoted replies, and IMAP single/bulk Trash with Undo: see the [mailbox workflow](docs/MAILBOX.en.md). You choose whether to load external images and confirm moves before they run."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "Open **Plugins** in the DSH desktop app and install `dsh-email`. If the CLI is available:\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile desktop add dsh-email\n```\n\nFor the web profile, replace `desktop` with `web`. Restart that DSH profile after installation. The package’s DSH requirement is `>=0.2.1-rc.3`."
    },
    {
      "section": "Start using it",
      "text": "1. Open Email account settings and configure your own IMAP/SMTP, OAuth or AgentMail account.\n2. Test the connection, select an account and browse Inbox and Sent in the mail workbench.\n3. Search and open a message, inspect its body and attachments, then ask for a reply draft without sending.\n4. Edit, save and preview the draft; verify To/Cc, attachments and sending account before confirming.\n5. Verify the result in Sent or the original thread. Recipient deny rules continue to take precedence."
    },
    {
      "section": "Start using it",
      "text": "Example request：\n\n> Read this message and prepare a reply draft. Do not send it yet."
    },
    {
      "section": "Before you start",
      "text": "Bring your mailbox authorization or AgentMail API key. POP3 has protocol-specific state and search limits. When the network only reaches a mail server through a proxy, add `proxy` to the account (or set `HTTPS_PROXY`); see the [usage guide](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-email/blob/main/docs/USAGE.en.md).\n\nConfiguration, detailed tools and troubleshooting: [full reference](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-email/blob/main/docs/REFERENCE.en.md)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Plugin updates",
      "text": "Check updates at the bottom of the workbench or native plugin details. Automatic checks are on by default; **automatic installation is off**. You choose whether to install and when to restart. Suite-managed components update with their bundle. [Update behavior](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-email/blob/main/docs/REFERENCE.en.md)."
    },
